[49.412, "o", "## First Time Login\r\n"]
[49.532, "o", "If you provided your own bootstrap password during installation, browse to https://rancher.home.arpa to get started.\r\n"]
[49.652, "o", "If this is the first time you installed Rancher, get started by running this command and clicking the URL it generates:\r\n"]
[49.772, "o", "```\r\n"]
[49.892, "o", "echo https://rancher.home.arpa/dashboard/?setup=$(kubectl get secret --namespace cattle-system bootstrap-secret -o go-template='{{.data.bootstrapPassword|base64decode}}')\r\n"]
[50.012, "o", "```\r\n"]
[50.132, "o", "To get just the bootstrap password on its own, run:\r\n"]
[50.252, "o", "```\r\n"]
[50.372, "o", "kubectl get secret --namespace cattle-system bootstrap-secret -o go-template='{{.data.bootstrapPassword|base64decode}}{{ \"\\n\" }}'\r\n"]
[50.492, "o", "```\r\n"]
[50.612, "o", "Happy Containering!\r\n"]
